{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eW_HFsTNYdeFdvf2vV5UFA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:16.556986+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eW_HFsTNYdeFdvf2vV5UFA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/qS0UZY36VmIzsAU4SlVFzgeoUuwticyOvibNlNicW5iatxEAthjmib9vwdqJLaP6HbDsWG2LlxuHkB8NXWYp37tNohw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qS0UZY36VmIzsAU4SlVFzgeoUuwticyOvtNA5wxWlonDib1Xs0C1qxfsKCuneeOWw7fpK6U41VgpcKWmkPuU7ibpQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>为促进全国优秀大学生与功能枢纽博士生导师的沟通和交流，更深入地了解功能枢纽四大学域，并切身感受在港科大（广州）校园的科研和日常生活，<span><strong>功能枢纽将于2025年6月12-14日</strong></span>举行<strong><span>2026年秋季博士项目夏令营</span></strong>，报名即日正式开启！</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>时间：</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p>2025年6月12-14日</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>地点：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>香港科技大学（广州）校园 </p><p>广州市南沙区笃学路1号</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>目标人群：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>有意申请功能枢纽博士项目的优秀在读本科生、硕士生以及在职人士</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>费用：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>本次夏令营免申请费，并为入营学生提供免费校内住宿，往返交通费用由学生自理。</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>活动内容：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p>博士项目宣讲、四大学域活动、师生面对面交流、校园及实验室参观、手工工坊等</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>申请人须登录申请系统</p><p>在线提交申请材料</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>夏令营官网：</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong>https://summercamp-funh.hkust-gz.edu.cn/#/home</strong></span></p></section><section><section><p>*官网为官方唯一申请渠道，港科大（广州）功能枢纽没有授权任何中介申请服务。</p></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>申请时间：</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><p>2025年3月14日-6月2日</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请材料</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>必要材料：<br/></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>●</span> 在读证明/学历证明</p><p><span>●</span> 学术简历</p><p><span>●</span> 最新官方成绩单</p><p><span>●</span> 身份证明（身份证、护照等）</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>可选材料：</strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>●</span> 英语成绩证明<br/></p><p><span>●</span> 获奖证书、发表的论文或著作、获批专利等其他材料</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>本次夏令营将安排数轮筛选，分批通知成功入营的同学，请留意来自<strong><span>summercamp-funh@hkust-gz.edu.cn</span></strong>的邮件。 </p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请小贴士</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>1. 报名夏令营需要填写第一志愿学域及第二志愿学域，第一志愿学域为必填，第二志愿学域为选填，建议学生都填写，以增加入选几率。</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>2. 每个志愿学域必须填写一位心仪导师，建议在功能枢纽官网和公众号提前了解学域及导师信息。</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>3. 在读学生需上传在读证明以及最新成绩单，建议尽快向你就读学校的有关部门申请。已毕业的申请者需上传本科及硕士（如有）的学位证、毕业证以及成绩单。</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p>4. 英语成绩可上传雅思、托福成绩单，也可上传四六级成绩单，本次英语成绩证明仅用于夏令营选拔，如正式申请功能枢纽博士项目，仅接受雅思及托福成绩。</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>活动安排</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>6月12日</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>上午：<span><strong>学生报到</strong></span></p><p>下午：<strong><span>枢纽分享</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>6月13日</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>上午：<strong><span>学域活动</span></strong></p><p>下午：<strong><span>对话导师</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>6月14日</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>上午：<strong><span>探趣科广</span></strong><span>（自愿报名）</span></p><p>上午-中午：<strong><span>学生离校</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>枢纽简介</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>功能枢纽是香港科技大学（广州）下设四大枢纽之一，其严谨探究和理解自然科学的基本属性与特点，并通过不断的突破与跨学科协作，以精深知识促进融合与重组的创新，集最前沿之想法解现实发展之困，对社会进步产生重大影响。功能枢纽着力培养具有独立思想的毕业生。现设先进材料、地球与海洋大气科学、微电子、可持续能源与环境四大融合学域。</p></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>先进材料学域</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><p><span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>地球与海洋大气科学学域</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><p><span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>微电子学域</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><p><span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>可持续能源与环境学域</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section